# Origin docs

`docs/` is the conceptual origin package (`00` through `04`). Do not rewrite, shorten, or "improve" it during refactors. Edit only when the user explicitly asks. Keep SPDX headers if you do edit.

Working plans live in `plans/` and are not origin. Do not copy them into `docs/` unless the user asked.
